# The hypervisor host driver's device node, like /dev/kvm and /dev/vhost-vsock in AOSP's
# ueventd.rc: open to every user, because crosvm runs as whoever starts it (an app through AVF, the
# control service as system); SELinux (xhyper_device, vendor/sepolicy) lets only crosvm open it.
/dev/xhyper    0666    root    root
